{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with spare bits of road, railway, and anything else to hand, take on the role of a city planner as you repair the routes for vehicles on your charming, low-poly city map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your targets will travel at different speeds, and they may travel on custom routes, so you will need to get creative and build around their various requirements. You may need to block access one way in order to free up another, or send cars in a loop to let a bullet train pass through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This charming puzzle game should be easy to learn, but hard to master in order to attain all the 3-star scores. Can you perfect every level?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Screw Loose","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907340/ff36881a69235a79dcda600b8bc55a20ea5b10fc.jpg"},{"name":"Tile Be Back","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907340/02b23d95c3823091deb0f32082d869fece399495.jpg"},{"name":"Mind the Gap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907340/545dae244294e685de97ebbf0003912e82981d2d.jpg"},{"name":"My Young Padavan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907340/71236e32235d88338d0e7dbde6c8a2aaafdda63c.jpg"},{"name":"Dual Wielding","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907340/bb4322fafc092df1f022dccb003f63528c465448.jpg"},{"name":"That'll Buff Right Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907340/86f5e14011b33b12d972d67e0526fc336e20242a.jpg"},{"name":"Transporter Pad","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907340/5db6ca68feb22fc938219c6ae623ed73d9efbfad.jpg"},{"name":"Skip to the End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907340/52f0294e73a34ed85208b9012727e4efda61e3c0